2026-10-04T18:54:59.6618950Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6619410Z 
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6620020Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6620940Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6651800Z 
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6652890Z I will:
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6653340Z 
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6655220Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6660550Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6661120Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6661440Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6661670Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6661980Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6662410Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6662990Z    /var/root
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6733560Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6740410Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6830460Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6831600Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6837200Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6838440Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6839310Z 
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6839930Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-04T18:54:59.6840590Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
