2026-10-04T18:55:19.8441030Z # and zshoptions(1) for more details.
2026-10-04T18:55:19.8441480Z 
2026-10-04T18:55:19.8444090Z # Correctly display UTF-8 with combining characters.  We'll assume UTF-8 if the
2026-10-04T18:55:19.8445680Z # locale(1) binary is missing entirely.
